## Scope

This repo is **pharmacy-erp-desktop**. Cursor rules apply to **backend** (`backend/`, NestJS + Prisma + TypeScript) and **frontend** (`src/app/`, Angular). Architecture docs live under `docs/pharmacy_erp_architecture_docs/`.

**Standard:** Follow [01-coding-principles.mdc](01-coding-principles.mdc) for all generated or modified code. Follow scoped `.mdc` rules in `.cursor/rules/` for backend and frontend work unless the user overrides a specific rule in the task.

---

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Backend runtime | Node.js |
| Backend framework | NestJS 11 |
| Frontend | Angular 19 (`src/app/`) |
| Language | TypeScript 5.7 |
| ORM | Prisma 7 (`@prisma/adapter-better-sqlite3`) |
| Database | SQLite (`db/pharmacy.sqlite`) |
| Validation | class-validator + class-transformer |
| Testing | Jest 30 (backend + Angular unit) |
| Lint / format | ESLint 9 (`typescript-eslint` type-checked) + Prettier (backend) |

