## Repository layout

```
backend/
  src/
    common/          # exceptions, interceptors, response types
    persistence/     # UnitOfWork, Outbox, Sequence, InventoryLedger, RequestContext
    prisma.service.ts
    prisma.module.ts
    app.module.ts
    main.ts
  seed/              # deterministic seed data + generators
  test/
    persistence/     # integration tests against seeded SQLite
docs/pharmacy_erp_architecture_docs/
  database/          # schema docs, persistence-patterns.md
db/
  pharmacy.sqlite
```

