## Key commands

Run from `backend/`:

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run start:dev` | Dev server with watch |
| `npm run build` | Compile NestJS |
| `npm run lint` | ESLint (auto-fix) |
| `npm run format` | Prettier write |
| `npm run test` | Unit tests (`src/**/*.spec.ts`) |
| `npm run test:watch` | Unit tests watch mode |
| `npm run test:cov` | Unit tests with coverage |
| `npm run test:persistence` | Persistence integration tests (`--runInBand`) |
| `npm run test:e2e` | End-to-end HTTP tests |
| `npm run db:seed` | Append seed (hydrate from DB, add demo data; no wipe) |
| `npm run db:seed:fresh` | Wipe seed tables + full reseed |
| `npm run db:reset` | Force-reset schema + fresh seed |

**Feature / single-file examples** (from `backend/`): `npm run test -- --testPathPatterns=party`, `npm run test -- party/customer.service.spec.ts`, `npm run test:e2e -- --testPathPatterns=auth.e2e-spec`. Angular unit tests from repo root: `npm test`. Full guide: `docs/pharmacy_erp_architecture_docs/architecture/testing.md`.

Before finishing backend changes, run `npm run lint` and relevant tests.

